OL,3,GNEWSABoy can 'enjoy being a child
OL,4,Aagain' after rare surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum says her seven-year-old son can
OL,7,F"enjoy being a child again" after
OL,8,Fbecoming one of the youngest people in
OL,9,Fthe UK to undergo a rare life-saving
OL,10,Fpancreas procedure.
OL,12,FCharlie, from Oxfordshire, was born
OL,13,Fwith hereditary pancreatitis that led
OL,14,Fto years of debilitating illness.
OL,16,FHe underwent a total pancreatectomy
OL,17,Fwith islet autotransplantation (TPIAT)
OL,18,Fat Oxford's John Radcliffe Hospital in
OL,19,FMarch. This involved removing his
OL,20,Fpancreas and transplanting his own
OL,21,Finsulin-producing cells into his liver.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
